{"schema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"MPItemFeedHeader":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"type":"object","title":"MPItemFeedHeader","properties":{"businessUnit":{"type":"string","title":"Business Unit","enum":["SAMSCLUB","WALMART_CA","WALMART_US","ASDA_GM"]},"locale":{"type":"string","title":"Locale","enum":["en"]},"version":{"type":"string","title":"Spec Version","enum":["5.0.20260501-19_21_29-api"]}},"required":["businessUnit","locale","version"]},"MPItem":{"minItems":1,"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"array","title":"MPItem","items":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"type":"object","properties":{"Visible":{"oneOf":[{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","required":["Breads & Buns"]}],"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"type":"object","title":"Visible","properties":{"Breads & Buns":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"isProp65WarningRequired":{"type":"string","enum":["Yes"]}},"required":["isProp65WarningRequired"]},"then":{"required":["prop65WarningText"]}}],"properties":{"productName":{"title":"Product Name","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 199 characters - Title of the product to be displayed on the Item Page. Your title should ideally be under 90 Characters, Maximum 100 Characters.  Anything over 90 characters will negatively impact your Search Engine Optimization (SEO). Example: Brand+ Product Line+ Claims/ Certifications+ Flavor+ Grain Type+ Bread & Bun Type, Size, Count per Pack+ Food Condition (list ONLY if Frozen)\n\nNature's Own Life Sugar-Free Whole Grain Bread Loaf, 16 oz\nBrand+ Product Line= Nature's Own Life\nClaims/ Certifications= Sugar-Free\nGrain Type- Whole Grain\nBread & Buns Type= Bread Loaf\nSize= 16 oz","examples":["Brand+ Product Line+ Claims/ Certifications+ Flavor+ Grain Type+ Bread & Bun Type, Size, Count per Pack+ Food Condition (list ONLY if Frozen)\n\nNature's Own Life Sugar-Free Whole Grain Bread Loaf, 16 oz\nBrand+ Product Line= Nature's Own Life\nClaims/ Certifications= Sugar-Free\nGrain Type- Whole Grain\nBread & Buns Type= Bread Loaf\nSize= 16 oz"],"comments":"@group=Basic Item Info","minLength":10,"maxLength":199},"brand":{"title":"Brand Name","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 60 characters - The official name of the company or trademark that makes the item. Example: Dave's Killer Bread\nSara Lee\nPilsbury","examples":["Dave's Killer Bread\nSara Lee\nPilsbury"],"comments":"@group=Basic Item Info","minLength":1,"maxLength":60},"shortDescription":{"title":"Site Description","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 100000 characters - Overview of the key selling points of the item, marketing content, and highlights in paragraph form. For SEO purposes, repeat the product name and relevant keywords here. Example: Dave's Killer Bread White Bread Done Right is our take on sliced white bread, featuring killer taste, an artisan-style texture and no bleached flour. Each USDA organic white bread slice includes 10 grams of whole grains, and is perfect for killer grilled cheese or rich French toast. This soft and smooth artisan-style bread loaf features five super grains: quinoa, spelt, rye, millet and barley—not to mention, no high-fructose corn syrup, no artificial preservatives and no artificial ingredients. You can trust Dave's Killer Bread® to deliver killer taste, texture and always be Non-GMO Project Verified. White Bread Done Right is just what you need for killer club sandwiches and fluffy PB&Js. For soft and smooth white bread, try Dave's Killer Bread® White Bread Done Right®.The story of Dave’s Killer Bread® began at the Portland Farmers Market, when Dave Dahl and his nephew brought some loaves of Dave's bread to sell. For Dave, this marked the beginning of a new chapter in his life. Though he grew up in a family of bakers, his life took a different path. A path that landed him in prison for 15 years. Determined to prove his worth and make a positive impact, Dave worked tirelessly to bake breads that tasted unlike anything else on the market — packed with seeds and grains, made with only the very best organic and Non-GMO Project Verified ingredients. Dave’s Killer Bread® believes everyone is capable of greatness. One in three of the company's employee partners at their Milwaukie, OR bakery has a criminal background—but your past doesn't define your future. As a proud Second Chance Employer, Dave’s Killer Bread® truly believes everyone deserves a second chance to become a Good Seed.","examples":["Dave's Killer Bread White Bread Done Right is our take on sliced white bread, featuring killer taste, an artisan-style texture and no bleached flour. Each USDA organic white bread slice includes 10 grams of whole grains, and is perfect for killer grilled cheese or rich French toast. This soft and smooth artisan-style bread loaf features five super grains: quinoa, spelt, rye, millet and barley—not to mention, no high-fructose corn syrup, no artificial preservatives and no artificial ingredients. You can trust Dave's Killer Bread® to deliver killer taste, texture and always be Non-GMO Project Verified. White Bread Done Right is just what you need for killer club sandwiches and fluffy PB&Js. For soft and smooth white bread, try Dave's Killer Bread® White Bread Done Right®.The story of Dave’s Killer Bread® began at the Portland Farmers Market, when Dave Dahl and his nephew brought some loaves of Dave's bread to sell. For Dave, this marked the beginning of a new chapter in his life. Though he grew up in a family of bakers, his life took a different path. A path that landed him in prison for 15 years. Determined to prove his worth and make a positive impact, Dave worked tirelessly to bake breads that tasted unlike anything else on the market — packed with seeds and grains, made with only the very best organic and Non-GMO Project Verified ingredients. Dave’s Killer Bread® believes everyone is capable of greatness. One in three of the company's employee partners at their Milwaukie, OR bakery has a criminal background—but your past doesn't define your future. As a proud Second Chance Employer, Dave’s Killer Bread® truly believes everyone deserves a second chance to become a Good Seed."],"comments":"@minimumWordCount=60;@recommendedWordCount=283;@group=Basic Item Info","minLength":1,"maxLength":100000},"keyFeatures":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Key Features","type":"array","description":"Alphanumeric, 10000 characters - Key features will appear as bulleted text on the item page and in search results. Key features help the user understand the benefits of the product with a simple and clean format.","comments":"@group=Basic Item Info;@recommendedEntry=5","items":{"title":"Key Features","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 10000 characters - Key features will appear as bulleted text on the item page and in search results. Key features help the user understand the benefits of the product with a simple and clean format.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10000},"minItems":1},"manufacturer":{"title":"Manufacturer Name","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 60 characters - The name of the manufacturer.\n\n Example: Flower Foods\nBimbo Bakeries USA","examples":["Flower Foods\nBimbo Bakeries USA"],"comments":"@group=Basic Item Info","minLength":1,"maxLength":60},"mainImageUrl":{"title":"Main Image URL","type":"string","description":"URL, 2500 characters - Web address that points to the primary image used to represent an item","comments":"@group=Images","minLength":1,"maxLength":2500,"format":"uri"},"productSecondaryImageURL":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Additional Image URL","type":"array","description":"URL, 2500 characters - Secondary images of the item. File Format: JPEG (.jpg). Recommended Pixel Dimensions: 2200px x 2200px. Minimum Pixel Dimensions for Zoom 1500px x 1500px. Resolution: 300 ppi. Maximum file size: 5MB. Aspect Ratio: 1:1 (Square). Recommended File Naming: GTIN-14 digit\nImage URLs should end in an image file type (.jpg) to follow best practices. They must link to a public image file that loads as an image","comments":"@group=Images;@recommendedEntry=6","items":{"title":"Additional Image URL","type":"string","description":"URL, 2500 characters - Secondary images of the item. File Format: JPEG (.jpg). Recommended Pixel Dimensions: 2200px x 2200px. Minimum Pixel Dimensions for Zoom 1500px x 1500px. Resolution: 300 ppi. Maximum file size: 5MB. Aspect Ratio: 1:1 (Square). Recommended File Naming: GTIN-14 digit\nImage URLs should end in an image file type (.jpg) to follow best practices. They must link to a public image file that loads as an image","minLength":1,"maxLength":2500,"format":"uri"},"minItems":1},"variantGroupId":{"title":"Variant Group ID","type":"string","description":"Alphanumeric, 300 characters - Required if item is a variant. Make up a number and/or letter code for \"Variant Group ID\" and add this to all variations of the same product. Partners must ensure uniqueness of their Variant Group IDs. Example: HANESV025","examples":["HANESV025"],"comments":"@group=Site Experience","minLength":1,"maxLength":300},"variantAttributeNames":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Variant Attribute Names","type":"array","description":"Closed List - The designated attribute by which an item is varying.","comments":"@group=Site Experience","items":{"title":"Variant Attribute Names","type":"string","description":"Closed List - The designated attribute by which an item is varying.","enum":["count","countPerPack","flavor","multipackQuantity","occasion","size","sportsLeague","sportsTeam","theme"]},"minItems":1},"isPrimaryVariant":{"title":"Is Primary Variant","type":"string","description":"Closed List - Note whether item is intended as the main variant in a variant grouping. The primary variant will appear as the image when customers search and the first image displayed on the item page. This should be set as \"Yes\" for only one item in a group of variants.","comments":"@group=Site Experience","enum":["No","Yes"]},"swatchImages":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Swatch Images","type":"array","description":"Enter the swatch image location in \"Swatch Image URL\" and its corresponding variant attribute name in \"Swatch Variant Attribute\". Required for products with visual variations, like color or pattern. List the swatches in the order you recommend they appear on the site.","comments":"@group=Site Experience","items":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Swatch Images","type":"object","description":"Enter the swatch image location in \"Swatch Image URL\" and its corresponding variant attribute name in \"Swatch Variant Attribute\". Required for products with visual variations, like color or pattern. List the swatches in the order you recommend they appear on the site.","properties":{"swatchVariantAttribute":{"title":"Swatch Variant Attribute","type":"string","description":"Closed List - Attribute name corresponding to the swatch.","enum":["count","countPerPack","flavor","multipackQuantity","occasion","size","sportsLeague","sportsTeam","theme"]},"swatchImageUrl":{"title":"Swatch Image URL","type":"string","description":"URL, 2500 characters - URL of the color or pattern swatch image. This is required for products with visual variations and will be shown as a small circle on the item page. File Format: JPEG (.jpg). Recommended Pixel Dimensions: 100px x 100px. Resolution: 300 ppi. Maximum file size: 5MB. Recommended File Naming: GTIN-14 digit. Provide the final destination image URL (no-redirects) that is publicly accessible (no username/password required.) Example: http://www.walmart.com/somepath/some-image.jpg","examples":["http://www.walmart.com/somepath/some-image.jpg"],"minLength":1,"maxLength":2500,"format":"uri"}},"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":1},"thirdPartyAccreditationSymbolOnProductPackageCode":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"Third Party Accreditation Symbol on Product Package Code","type":"array","description":"Closed List - The code representing a symbol or marking third party accreditation on the product package.","comments":"@group=Compliance & Regulatory","items":{"title":"Third Party Accreditation Symbol on Product Package Code","type":"string","description":"Closed List - The code representing a symbol or marking third party accreditation on the product package.","enum":["100 Percent Canadian Milk","100% Veganskt","Absence of Eggs and Milk is a Certified Allergen Control (CAC)","Absence of Eggs, Milk and Peanuts is a Certified Allergen Control (CAC)","Absence of Peanuts & Almonds is a Certified Allergen Control (CAC)","ACMI","ADCCPA","AFIA Pet Food Facility","Agence Bio","AGRI Confiance","Agri Natura","Agriculture Biologique","Air cleaner performance standard e.g., humidifiers","Aise","Aise 2005","Aise 2010","Aliments BIO Prepares au Quebec","Aliments du Quebec","Aliments du Quebec BIO","Aliments Prepares au Quebec","Alpinavera","Aluminium Gesamtverband der Aluminiumindustrie","AMA Organic Seal","Ama Organic Seal Black","Ama Seal of Approval","American Dental Association","American Heart Association Certified","Animal Welfare Approved Grassfed","Appellation Origine Controlee","Approved by the Asthma and Allergy Association","Aqua GAP","Aquaculture Stewardship Council","Arla Farmer Owned","Asmi","Asthma and Allergy Foundation of America","ATG","Atlanta Kashrus Commission Certification","Bais Din of Crown Heights Vaad HaKashrus Certification","BC SPCA","BDIH Logo","Bebat","Belgaqua","Benor","Berchtesgadener Land","Best Aquaculture Practices","Best Aquaculture Practices 2 Sta